{"version":1,"content":"<p>《GTA6》正式上線後，玩家圍繞遊戲的爭議逐漸增多。除了30幀鎖定、Bug、崩潰、卡死等技術問題，以及遊戲節奏偏慢、任務缺乏趣味性等抱怨外，部分玩家開始將矛頭指向遊戲的劇情設計和人物塑造，認為這部耗費多年打造的作品充斥着政治正確，甚至將男主角塑造成了一個缺乏主導權的角色。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587194.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:03:58.641436+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:40:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.137144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.137144+00:00","content_hash":"60b6b78883127d675773d8f030c3170baa909b2d9cc5afbfcfa7db29a59de6ce","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}